Files under `src/wiki_mcp/` are derived from the upstream project. Each such file carries
a header naming the upstream file it came from and summarising what changed.

Substantive modifications made by this project:

  * `knowledge_base` (per-user vault) replaced by `scope` — the visibility
    partition from `docs/erdTable.sql` (`wiki_scope.scope_key`). A scope is
    never created by the agent; the backend owns it.
  * Hosted mode removed: Supabase/Postgres backend, S3 storage, OAuth, the
    HTTP transport, and `add_source_from_url`.
  * Highlights/annotations, courses, image and spreadsheet reading removed.
  * `overview.md` renamed `index.md` to match `wiki_scope.index_path`.
  * The index is no longer the agent's responsibility: this project has a
    DB and a scope-listing endpoint that upstream (filesystem-only) did not
    have, so Spring renders the index instead of the agent maintaining it.
  * Wiki page directories map to `wiki_category`; `category` added to the
    required frontmatter because `wiki.wiki_category_id` is NOT NULL.
  * Cross-page markdown links are permitted only within one scope. A link
    that leaves its scope is a lint error, because a body link cannot be
    filtered per viewer (FR-ACL-006, NFR-SEC-003).
